up pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Acidlands</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"NPC\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">NPC</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Goblin</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.75.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">February 1st, 2025</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\nThe <b>Goblin Town</b> is a series of stores located in the <a href=\"/wiki/Acidlands\" title=\"Acidlands\">Acidland</a> Caves.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The Town is mainly used as a hub full of passive Goblins that will not attack the player. Located directly behind the Goblin Arena.\n</p><p>To gain access to the Goblin Town you must prove yourself worthy by talking to the Goblin located within <a href=\"/wiki/The_Arena\" title=\"The Arena\">the arena</a>. He will give the player a Quest to kill the <a href=\"/wiki/Skeleton_King\" title=\"Skeleton King\">Skeleton King</a> and retrieve the <a href=\"/wiki/Acid_Crown\" title=\"Acid Crown\">Acid Crown</a>. After you complete the quest upon returning to the Goblin, it will initiate the Goblin Trials which is a challenge that consists of eliminating multiple waves of enemies in order to gain access to the town. \n</p><p>The Goblins sell items that are mostly related to improving the player's ability to defeat mobs from the <a href=\"/wiki/Acidlands\" title=\"Acidlands\">Acidlands</a>.\n</p><p>The Goblin Town is found by going in the <a href=\"/wiki/Acidlands\" title=\"Acidlands\">Acidland</a> Caves and following the path relative to the entrance from the main <a href=\"/wiki/Acidlands\" title=\"Acidlands\">Acidlands</a> entrance. Following the route will lead to a visible inner island inside the cave which crossing over will reveal the goblin arena tucked back in the inner part of the cave. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inventory\">Inventory</span></h2>\n<p>This table shows all items available at the stores.\n</p>\n<table class=\"fandom-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Price\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Uranium_lantern\" title=\"Uranium lantern\">Uranium Lantern</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/6a/Uraniumlanternboxed.png/revision/latest?cb=20250308140253\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Uraniumlanternboxed\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/6a/Uraniumlanternboxed.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/167?cb=20250308140253\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"167\" height=\"229\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Uraniumlanternboxed.png\" data-image-key=\"Uraniumlanternboxed.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>$500\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Boxed Acid\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b1/Missing_Image.png/revision/latest?cb=20250220182005\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Missing Image\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b1/Missing_Image.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/237?cb=20250220182005\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"237\" height=\"237\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Missing Image.png\" data-image-key=\"Missing_Image.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>$4,480\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Goblin_Caverns\" title=\"The Goblin Caverns\">The Goblin Taverns</a>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/The_Goblin_Caverns\" title=\"The Goblin Caverns\">Music Disk</a>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/08/The_Goblin_Caverns.png/revision/latest?cb=20250309093241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The Goblin Caverns\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/08/The_Goblin_Caverns.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/146?cb=20250309093241\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"146\" height=\"144\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"The Goblin Caverns.png\" data-image-key=\"The_Goblin_Caverns.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>$1,600\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_Sword\" title=\"Wooden Sword\">Wooden Sword</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/cd/Wooden_Sword.png/revision/latest?cb=20250210223419\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Wooden Sword\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"167\" height=\"457\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Wooden Sword.png\" data-image-key=\"Wooden_Sword.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/cd/Wooden_Sword.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/167?cb=20250210223419\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>$600\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_Bow\" title=\"Wooden Bow\">Wooden Bow</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a h